      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004900740020007700610073002000740068006900730020004400720069006C0062007500720000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "A Pokémon, eh?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nWell, it’s still gotta answer for its crimes against\nour garden! I’m takin’ it to the office!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
