    },
    {
      "displayText": "Doesn’t matter if you’re a Pokémon or a person.\nIf you cause trouble, you gotta make things right!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nSo go on, then! You better make this garden look\ngood as new!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
